Supplier Risk Analysis & Freight Logistics Optimization Pipeline

### Supplier Performance | Procurement Analytics | Freight Optimization | OTIF | Supply Chain Risk Management

---

## 1. Project Overview

Supplier reliability and transportation performance are critical factors in maintaining an efficient and resilient supply chain.

This project focuses on developing a data-driven supplier risk analysis and freight logistics optimization pipeline to evaluate supplier delivery performance, identify procurement risks, monitor lead-time variability and improve On-Time In-Full (OTIF) delivery compliance.

Using SQL, Python, Tableau, Excel VBA and SAP SCM data concepts, the analytical framework helps supply chain teams identify underperforming suppliers, investigate freight delays, evaluate purchase order performance and prioritize corrective actions.

**Primary objective:** Transform supplier and logistics data into actionable insights that support procurement decisions, improve delivery reliability and strengthen supply chain performance.

## 2. Business Problem

Which suppliers, transportation lanes and purchase orders require immediate attention because of:

- Repeated late deliveries.
- Unpredictable supplier lead times.
- Freight transportation delays.
- Incomplete purchase order deliveries.
- Supplier pricing and cost variances.
- Poor On-Time In-Full (OTIF) performance.
- Potential disruptions to material availability.

Without structured supplier performance monitoring, procurement and supply chain teams may struggle to identify risks early, evaluate supplier reliability and make informed sourcing decisions.

